* Abstract
  - CAL group discovered failure in the calibration measurement on Nov. 13th, which was done just after recoverying the laser trouble.
    - Reference: [[https://gwdoc.icrr.u-tokyo.ac.jp/cgi-bin/private/DocDB/ShowDocument?docid=17423][JGW-G2617423]]
  - Since we are unable to provide an error assessment for the relevant period, we have decieded to exclude it from Analysis Ready.
  - The relevant period is the time from the first return to observing mode following a laser malfunction until the start of the first weekly maintenance
    - *from 09:48:01 UTC on November 13, 2025 (GPS = 1447062499)*
    - *to 00:09:56 on November 14, 2025 (GPS = 1447114214)*

* Related files
  - =makeSegmentFile.py=
    - A script to generate a segment XML file including "=K1:CAL_HOFT_NOT_OK_INVALID_MEASUREMENT:1="
    - "=known SegmentList=" is set as a O4c period in which KAGRA detector joined.
      - *from 15:00:00 UTC on June 11, 2025 (GPS=1433689218)*
      - *to 16:00:00 UTC on November 18, 2025 (GPS=1447516818)*
    - "=active SegmentList=" is the relevant period descrived above.
  - =K1-CAL_HOFT_NOT_OK_INVALID_MEASUREMENT_O4c.xml=
    - A segment XML file including "=K1:CAL_HOFT_NOT_OK_INVALID_MEASUREMENT:1="

